#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:11
msgid "a doctor abroad can treat us without paper or an app"
msgstr "国外的医生无需纸质记录或应用即可为我们诊治"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:154
#, python-brace-format
msgid "A wrong passcode is refused, and the attempt is still logged in Onesa ({code0}). If the HCERT does not verify (for example, Country B's DSC is missing from the cached list), there is no digital verification. The clinic names the step and the reason (<a0>STT-VER-008</a0>), does not follow the VHL, and Dr Anan treats whatever the family can show as he would a paper record."
msgstr "错误的通行码会被拒绝，但该尝试仍会在奥内萨（Onesa）被记录（{code0}）。如果 HCERT 未通过验证（例如，缓存列表中缺少 B 国的 DSC），则不进行数字验证。诊所指明失败的步骤和原因（<a0>STT-VER-008</a0>），不跟随该 VHL，Dr Anan 将家庭能出示的任何内容当作纸质记录来对待。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:144
msgid "Back where it began, Dr Anan sees Somsack at a primary care clinic in Kesaro. Bounmy shows the QR on his phone and says the passcode. The clinic viewer and the Onesan gateway take five steps:"
msgstr "回到故事开始的地方，Dr Anan 在 Kesaro 的一家初级卫生保健诊所为 Somsack 看诊。Bounmy 在手机上出示 QR 码并说出通行码。诊所查看器和奥内萨网关执行五个步骤："

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:13
msgid "Birth clinic vaccinator"
msgstr "出生诊所疫苗接种员"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:10
#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:11
#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:12
msgid "Caregiver"
msgstr "照护者"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:14
#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:15
#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:16
msgid "Community health worker"
msgstr "社区卫生工作者"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:12
msgid "Decide who sees my child's record, and for how long"
msgstr "决定谁可以查看我孩子的记录，以及可以查看多久"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:26
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Each step names the requirements of <a0>smart-trust-tools</a0> it exercises, and the FHIR examples of this guide it produces. The stories are in <a1>{code0}</a1>. Each moment ends with its pain point, what enables it, and the policy point it makes, as the VaxLink walkthrough presents them."
msgstr "每个步骤都列出它所运用的 <a0>smart-trust-tools</a0> 需求，以及它所产生的本指南 FHIR 示例。用户故事位于 <a1>{code0}</a1> 中。每个时刻都以其痛点、促成因素及其所体现的政策要点结尾，与 VaxLink 演练中的呈现方式一致。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:6
msgid "Each story traces to the smart-trust-tools requirements that serve it (scenarios/story-requirements.json); where the HCERT library does not serve a story, the note says what does."
msgstr "每个用户故事都可追溯到服务于它的 smart-trust-tools 需求（scenarios/story-requirements.json）；当 HCERT 库不服务于某个故事时，注释会说明由什么来服务。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:79
msgid "Enabler (J2a): The phone reads the card offline, and keeps “what the family told us” clearly separate from “what we have verified”."
msgstr "促成因素（J2a）：手机离线读取卡片，并将“家庭告诉我们的内容”与“我们已验证的内容”明确区分开。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:80
msgid "Enabler (J2b): An offline form links the baby to his household immediately; it syncs once the phone finds a signal."
msgstr "促成因素（J2b）：离线表单立即将婴儿关联到其家庭；手机一旦有信号便会同步。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:110
msgid "Enabler (J3a): Taifafeki’s signing key is on the shared WHO trust list, so any clinic can check it locally."
msgstr "促成因素（J3a）：泰法费基的签名密钥位于共享的 WHO 信任列表上，因此任何诊所都可以在本地进行核验。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:111
msgid "Enabler (J3b): Taifafeki’s original code is kept and the Onesan code is added alongside; the schedule engine calculates what’s due."
msgstr "促成因素（J3b）：保留泰法费基的原始代码，并在其旁添加奥内萨代码；接种计划引擎计算应接种的剂次。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:135
msgid "Enabler (J4.0a): A household wallet on one phone, with a separate health summary for each person."
msgstr "促成因素（J4.0a）：一部手机上的家庭钱包，每人有一份单独的健康摘要。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:136
msgid "Enabler (J4.0b): A Verifiable Health Link: the QR holds only a locked pointer; the data stays home until the passcode is given."
msgstr "促成因素（J4.0b）：可验证健康链接（Verifiable Health Link）：QR 码只包含一个加锁的指针；在提供通行码之前，数据始终留在本国。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:57
msgid "Enabler: A digitally signed QR card travels with the family — no ID number or database lookup needed."
msgstr "促成因素：经数字签名的 QR 卡片随家庭携带——无需 ID 号码或数据库查询。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:162
msgid "Enabler: The record is fetched live from Onesa, viewed without being copied, and an access log is sent home."
msgstr "促成因素：记录从奥内萨（Onesa）实时获取，仅查看而不复制，并将访问日志发回本国。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:10
msgid "Have my son's birth doses from abroad recognised at home"
msgstr "让我儿子在国外接种的出生剂次在本国得到认可"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:10
msgid "his care does not start over and nothing is repeated"
msgstr "他的医疗照护不必从头开始，也不会重复接种"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:17
#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:18
#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:19
msgid "Home clinic provider"
msgstr "所属诊所医务人员"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:21
msgid "I can rely on it as I would on my own clinic's record"
msgstr "我可以像信赖本诊所的记录一样信赖它"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:18
msgid "I give only what is missing"
msgstr "我只补种缺少的剂次"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:8
msgid "I want to"
msgstr "我想要"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:127
msgid "It assembles the IPS and Somsack's DVCs."
msgstr "它汇总 IPS 和 Somsack 的 DVC。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:44
msgid "It builds a DVCMinPreQual payload: <a0>STT-PAY-001</a0>…<a1>005</a1> and <a2>STT-PAY-007</a2>, with subclaim −6 (<a3>STT-SEL-003</a3>). No identity document is needed (<a4>STT-PAY-005</a4>)."
msgstr "它构建一个 DVCMinPreQual 载荷：<a0>STT-PAY-001</a0>…<a1>005</a1> 和 <a2>STT-PAY-007</a2>，子声明为 −6（<a3>STT-SEL-003</a3>）。无需身份证件（<a4>STT-PAY-005</a4>）。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:128
msgid "It encrypts them (<a0>STT-VHL-004</a0>, <a1>STT-VHL-007</a1>) behind a passcode-protected manifest with an expiry (<a2>STT-VHL-009</a2>)."
msgstr "它将其加密（<a0>STT-VHL-004</a0>、<a1>STT-VHL-007</a1>），置于一个受通行码保护且有有效期的清单之后（<a2>STT-VHL-009</a2>）。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:46
msgid "It has XXR's key sign them (<a0>STT-COS-002</a0>, <a1>STT-COS-006</a1>), then finishes the HC1 text: <a2>STT-COS-001</a2>, <a3>STT-ZIP-001</a3>, <a4>STT-B45-001</a4>, <a5>STT-HC1-001</a5>, <a6>STT-QR-001</a6>."
msgstr "它用 XXR 的密钥对其签名（<a0>STT-COS-002</a0>、<a1>STT-COS-006</a1>），然后完成 HC1 文本：<a2>STT-COS-001</a2>、<a3>STT-ZIP-001</a3>、<a4>STT-B45-001</a4>、<a5>STT-HC1-001</a5>、<a6>STT-QR-001</a6>。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:129
msgid "It issues the link as an HCERT, with the VHL at key 5 (<a0>STT-VHL-001</a0>, <a1>STT-VHL-002</a1>), signed with Country B's DSC."
msgstr "它将该链接签发为一个 HCERT，VHL 位于键 5（<a0>STT-VHL-001</a0>、<a1>STT-VHL-002</a1>），并用 B 国的 DSC 签名。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:45
msgid "It prepares the CWT and the bytes to sign: <a0>STT-CWT-001</a0>…<a1>005</a1>, <a2>STT-ISS-004</a2>."
msgstr "它准备 CWT 和待签名的字节：<a0>STT-CWT-001</a0>…<a1>005</a1>、<a2>STT-ISS-004</a2>。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:149
msgid "It requests the manifest by ITI-YY5, signed with HTTP Message Signatures (<a0>STT-VHL-005</a0>, <a1>STT-VHL-006</a1>, <a2>STT-VHL-008</a2>)."
msgstr "它通过 ITI-YY5 请求清单，请求使用 HTTP Message Signatures（HTTP 消息签名）签名（<a0>STT-VHL-005</a0>、<a1>STT-VHL-006</a1>、<a2>STT-VHL-008</a2>）。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:152
msgid "It shows them to Dr Anan: every dose since the birth, viewed, never copied."
msgstr "它将其展示给 Dr Anan：出生以来的每一个剂次，仅查看，从不复制。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:35
msgid "J1 — Born abroad (Taifafeki, birth day)"
msgstr "J1 — 出生在国外（泰法费基，出生当天）"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:60
msgid "J2 — Found at home (Onesa, 3 weeks later)"
msgstr "J2 — 在本国被发现（奥内萨（Onesa），3 周后）"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:62
msgid "J2a. On a routine visit to Village 04, Vilay finds a newborn the Onesan system does not know exists. Her phone has had no signal for weeks. Khamla shows the two cards. The CHW app reads them with read-unverified (<a0>STT-VER-011</a0>; <a1>STT-B45-002</a1>, <a2>STT-ZIP-002</a2>, <a3>STT-CBR-003</a3>), which needs no trust list. It shows the doses, but checks no signature and saves nothing yet."
msgstr "J2a. 在一次对 Village 04 的例行走访中，Vilay 发现了一名奥内萨系统并不知道其存在的新生儿。她的手机已经好几周没有信号了。Khamla 出示两张卡片。CHW 应用以“未验证读取”（read-unverified）方式读取它们（<a0>STT-VER-011</a0>；<a1>STT-B45-002</a1>、<a2>STT-ZIP-002</a2>、<a3>STT-CBR-003</a3>），这不需要信任列表。它显示剂次，但不核验任何签名，也暂不保存任何内容。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:68
#, python-brace-format
msgid "J2b. On the CHW app's newborn form (structured data capture, {code0}) she adds Somsack to the Sengmany household ({code1}), with a temporary id. Bounmy confirms the details as head of household. The app saves the doses read from the cards as reported by the family, not verified ({code2}, {code3}: {code4} false). Vilay refers Somsack to the district health center ({code5}). Everything stays queued on the phone, for 28 days if need be, and syncs when it next reaches a signal."
msgstr "J2b. 她在 CHW 应用的新生儿表单（结构化数据采集，{code0}）上，以临时 id 将 Somsack 添加到 Sengmany 家庭（{code1}）。Bounmy 作为户主确认这些信息。应用将从卡片读取的剂次保存为家庭报告、未经验证（{code2}、{code3}：{code4} 为 false）。Vilay 将 Somsack 转诊到区卫生中心（{code5}）。所有内容都在手机上排队，必要时可保留 28 天，并在下次有信号时同步。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:84
msgid "J3 — Made official (Lomaru District Health Center, 4 weeks later)"
msgstr "J3 — 正式入册（Lomaru 区卫生中心，4 周后）"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:88
#, python-brace-format
msgid "J3a. Nurse Chanthasone opens the referral and scans the QRs. The EHR verifies each DVC offline against that copy (<a0>STT-VER-001</a0>…<a1>009</a1>, <a2>STT-KID-002</a2>), without contacting Taifafeki. Both verify, so it imports them as FHIR {code0}s ({code1}, {code2}) with provenance ({code3}; <a3>STT-VER-007</a3>, <a4>STT-VER-008</a4>), replacing the reported doses of J2. If a DVC fails (a tampered card, say), the EHR names the step and the reason, the doses stay unverified, and the nurse decides by national catch-up policy."
msgstr "J3a. 护士 Chanthasone 打开转诊并扫描 QR 码。EHR 对照该副本离线验证每份 DVC（<a0>STT-VER-001</a0>…<a1>009</a1>、<a2>STT-KID-002</a2>），无需联系泰法费基。两份均通过验证，因此它将其作为 FHIR {code0} 导入（{code1}、{code2}），并附来源记录（{code3}；<a3>STT-VER-007</a3>、<a4>STT-VER-008</a4>），取代 J2 中的已报告剂次。如果某份 DVC 验证失败（例如卡片被篡改），EHR 会指明失败的步骤和原因，剂次保持未验证状态，由护士根据国家补种政策作出决定。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:97
#, python-brace-format
msgid "J3b. The Taifafeki Hep B product matches nothing on the national schedule. The EHR keeps Taifafeki's product coding and adds the schedule coding beside it, from the national map ({code0}). For the Hep B product the map has no entry, so Nurse Chanthasone makes the clinical call that it is the schedule's birth dose ({code1}), and her decision is added to the map for the next clinic. The schedule ({code2}) then runs: the birth doses count, and pentavalent 1, bOPV 1 and PCV 1 are due at 6 weeks ({code3}). Khamla leaves with the date ({code4}). Over the year Somsack gets those doses and measles-rubella at 9 months, in Onesa."
msgstr "J3b. 泰法费基的 Hep B 产品与国家接种计划中的任何条目都不匹配。EHR 保留泰法费基的产品编码，并根据国家映射表（{code0}）在其旁添加接种计划编码。映射表中没有该 Hep B 产品的条目，因此护士 Chanthasone 作出临床判断，认定它是接种计划中的出生剂次（{code1}），她的决定被添加到映射表中，供下一家诊所使用。随后运行接种计划（{code2}）：出生剂次计入，五联疫苗第 1 剂、bOPV 第 1 剂和 PCV 第 1 剂在 6 周时到期（{code3}）。Khamla 带着日期离开（{code4}）。在这一年中，Somsack 在奥内萨（Onesa）接种了这些剂次，并在 9 个月时接种了麻疹-风疹疫苗。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:115
msgid "J4.0 — Crossing back: one family, one phone (Onesa, 12 months later)"
msgstr "J4.0 — 再次跨境：一个家庭，一部手机（奥内萨（Onesa），12 个月后）"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:117
#, python-brace-format
msgid "J4.0a. The family plans a trip to Taifafeki. Bounmy's phone holds the family wallet, with a profile for each of them. Somsack's summary ({code0}) shows six doses: two from Taifafeki, four from Onesa."
msgstr "J4.0a. 这家人计划去泰法费基旅行。Bounmy 的手机中有家庭钱包，每位家庭成员都有一个档案。Somsack 的摘要（{code0}）显示六个剂次：两个来自泰法费基，四个来自奥内萨（Onesa）。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:123
#, python-brace-format
msgid "J4.0b. For Somsack, Bounmy shares his record with a 4-digit passcode he can say aloud, valid for 14 days. The portal records his consent ({code0}), then does three things:"
msgstr "J4.0b. Bounmy 为 Somsack 分享其记录，使用一个可以口头说出的 4 位通行码，有效期 14 天。门户记录他的同意（{code0}），然后执行三件事："

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:140
msgid "J4.1 — Crossing back: a Taifafeki doctor sees the full history (Kesaro, 12 months later)"
msgstr "J4.1 — 再次跨境：泰法费基医生看到完整的接种史（Kesaro，12 个月后）"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:19
msgid "Keep the foreign vaccine code and add our schedule code beside it, deciding myself when there is no match"
msgstr "保留外国疫苗代码并在其旁添加我们的接种计划代码，在没有匹配项时由我自己决定"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:39
msgid "Khamla gives birth to Somsack on 2025-10-28 at Kesaro Provincial Hospital, away from home. He has no Taifafeki identity number. Dr Anan gives the Hep B and BCG birth doses and records them with their WHO PreQual product codes. For each dose, the hospital system does three things:"
msgstr "2025-10-28，Khamla 在离家在外的 Kesaro 府医院生下 Somsack。他没有泰法费基身份号码。Dr Anan 为他接种 Hep B 和 BCG 出生剂次，并以其 WHO PreQual 产品代码进行记录。对于每个剂次，医院系统执行三件事："

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:48
msgid "Khamla leaves with two paper DVCs. In the demo: the library tests use the WHO guide's own two signed HC1 strings (<a0>QR Code Generation §12</a0>), which verify against the live DEV trust list under the same XXR key. Somsack's DVC payloads are illustrative, as in VaxLink. Live issuance in the app uses a TEST-ONLY key (<a1>STT-ISS-003</a1>), whose DSC is not on the GDHCN list, so its DVCs do not verify in J3."
msgstr "Khamla 带着两份纸质 DVC 离开。在演示中：库测试使用 WHO 指南自带的两个已签名 HC1 字符串（<a0>QR Code Generation §12</a0>），它们在同一 XXR 密钥下对照实时 DEV 信任列表通过验证。Somsack 的 DVC 载荷仅作示意，与 VaxLink 中相同。应用中的实时签发使用一个 TEST-ONLY 密钥（<a1>STT-ISS-003</a1>），其 DSC 不在 GDHCN 列表上，因此其签发的 DVC 在 J3 中无法通过验证。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:21
msgid "Know the record I read abroad came from the child's home country and was not altered"
msgstr "确认我在国外读取的记录来自孩子的本国且未被篡改"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:17
msgid "Know whether a foreign certificate is genuine, and why not when it is not"
msgstr "知道一份外国证书是否真实，以及不真实时的原因"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:16
msgid "no newborn in my village is missed, even with no signal"
msgstr "即使没有信号，我村里也不会遗漏任何新生儿"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:77
msgid "Pain point (J2a): Without a check, a forged or mistyped card could quietly become an official record."
msgstr "痛点（J2a）：如果不加核验，一张伪造或录入错误的卡片可能会悄无声息地变成官方记录。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:78
msgid "Pain point (J2b): Babies born abroad are invisible to the home health system until civil registration catches up — sometimes months later."
msgstr "痛点（J2b）：在国外出生的婴儿在民事登记跟进之前（有时要几个月之后），对本国卫生系统而言是不可见的。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:108
msgid "Pain point (J3a): Clinicians either distrust foreign paper and re-vaccinate, or trust it blindly."
msgstr "痛点（J3a）：临床医生要么不信任外国纸质记录而重新接种，要么盲目信任它。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:109
msgid "Pain point (J3b): Countries name and package vaccines differently, so doses get missed or repeated."
msgstr "痛点（J3b）：各国对疫苗的命名和包装方式不同，因此剂次会被遗漏或重复。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:133
msgid "Pain point (J4.0a): Many families share one smartphone; one-app-per-person designs leave them out."
msgstr "痛点（J4.0a）：许多家庭共用一部智能手机；一人一个应用的设计将他们排除在外。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:134
msgid "Pain point (J4.0b): Sending photos or PDFs of records leaks data and can’t be verified by the receiver."
msgstr "痛点（J4.0b）：发送记录的照片或 PDF 会泄露数据，且接收方无法验证。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:56
msgid "Pain point: The baby has no Taifafeki ID number, so his records would normally stay locked inside the Taifafeki hospital’s system."
msgstr "痛点：婴儿没有泰法费基 ID 号码，因此他的记录通常会被锁在泰法费基医院的系统内。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:161
msgid "Pain point: Without the history, the doctor would repeat vaccines or have to guess."
msgstr "痛点：没有接种史，医生就会重复接种疫苗，或者只能猜测。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:20
#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:21
msgid "Point-of-care provider"
msgstr "医疗服务点医务人员"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:81
msgid "Policy (J2a): Keep a clear line between what families report and what has been verified, and don’t grant trust too early."
msgstr "政策（J2a）：在家庭报告的内容与已验证的内容之间划清界限，不要过早给予信任。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:82
msgid "Policy (J2b): Newborns can be registered at home, offline, before civil registration or a national ID exists."
msgstr "政策（J2b）：新生儿可以在本国离线登记，无需等待民事登记或国民 ID。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:112
msgid "Policy (J3a): Trust is decentralized: an Onesan clinic verifies a Taifafeki signature itself, without contacting Taifafeki."
msgstr "政策（J3a）：信任是去中心化的：奥内萨诊所自行验证泰法费基的签名，无需联系泰法费基。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:113
msgid "Policy (J3b): Never overwrite another country’s record: keep the original coding alongside the national one."
msgstr "政策（J3b）：绝不覆盖另一国家的记录：在本国编码旁保留原始编码。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:137
msgid "Policy (J4.0a): Design for shared devices (“One Family, One Phone”) so families with only one phone aren’t left out."
msgstr "政策（J4.0a）：为共享设备而设计（“一个家庭，一部手机”），使只有一部手机的家庭不被排除在外。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:138
msgid "Policy (J4.0b): Data sovereignty: the record stays in Onesa until the family authorizes someone to open it."
msgstr "政策（J4.0b）：数据主权：在家庭授权某人打开之前，记录始终留在奥内萨（Onesa）。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:58
msgid "Policy: Babies born abroad can get a verifiable vaccine record before they have the host country’s civil registration or a national ID — and registering the birth at home still matters."
msgstr "政策：在国外出生的婴儿可以在取得所在国民事登记或国民 ID之前获得可验证的疫苗接种记录——而在本国登记出生仍然很重要。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:163
msgid "Policy: Continuity of care across borders: each country keeps its own records, with no international patient registry and no vendor lock-in. What is agreed regionally is the data model and the trust list, not a shared copy of the data."
msgstr "政策：跨境照护的连续性：各国保留各自的记录，没有国际患者登记系统，也没有供应商锁定。在区域层面达成一致的是数据模型和信任列表，而不是共享的数据副本。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:121
msgid "Precondition, as in J1: Country B's DSC, under Country B's CSCA, is already shared with the GDHCN, the Trust Anchor. That is what lets the clinic in Taifafeki verify the link in J4.1."
msgstr "前提条件，与 J1 中相同：B 国的 DSC（隶属 B 国的 CSCA）已与作为信任锚的 GDHCN 共享。正是这一点使泰法费基的诊所能够在 J4.1 中验证该链接。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:142
msgid "Precondition, as in J3: the DID documents are already loaded. The clinic viewer's trust store is a cached copy of the GDHCN trust list, including Country B's DSC DID document (<a0>STT-TRU-001</a0>, <a1>STT-TRU-002</a1>, <a2>STT-TRU-005</a2>). The clinic refreshes it nightly or hourly, against about weekly at the offline J3 clinic. It does not need to be online to verify: verifying reads the cache and never fetches the list. A DSC published after the last refresh fails the trust-list check (<a3>STT-VER-006</a3>), naming that reason."
msgstr "前提条件，与 J3 中相同：DID 文档已经加载。诊所查看器的信任存储是 GDHCN 信任列表的缓存副本，其中包括 B 国 DSC 的 DID 文档（<a0>STT-TRU-001</a0>、<a1>STT-TRU-002</a1>、<a2>STT-TRU-005</a2>）。该诊所每晚或每小时刷新一次，而离线的 J3 诊所大约每周刷新一次。验证时无需在线：验证读取缓存，从不获取列表。在最近一次刷新之后发布的 DSC 无法通过信任列表核验（<a3>STT-VER-006</a3>），并会指明该原因。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:86
msgid "Precondition: the DID documents are already loaded. Loading them is not a step of this visit. The clinic may be offline all day, so the EHR fetches nothing during it: its trust store holds the GDHCN DEV trust list as it was last refreshed, including XXR's DSC DID document (<a0>STT-TRU-001</a0>, <a1>STT-TRU-002</a1>, <a2>STT-TRU-005</a2>). A clinic with no connection of its own refreshes it about weekly, when the CHW visits the base clinic or district health office, where Country B retrieves the list the GDHCN trust anchor distributes. A DSC published after that refresh is not in the clinic's copy, so its DVC fails the trust-list check (<a3>STT-VER-006</a3>) until the next refresh."
msgstr "前提条件：DID 文档已经加载。加载它们不是本次就诊的步骤。诊所可能整天离线，因此 EHR 在此期间不获取任何内容：其信任存储保存的是最近一次刷新时的 GDHCN DEV 信任列表，其中包括 XXR 的 DSC DID 文档（<a0>STT-TRU-001</a0>、<a1>STT-TRU-002</a1>、<a2>STT-TRU-005</a2>）。自身没有网络连接的诊所大约每周刷新一次，即在 CHW 前往基地诊所或区卫生办公室时进行，B 国在那里获取 GDHCN 信任锚分发的列表。在该次刷新之后发布的 DSC 不在诊所的副本中，因此在下次刷新之前，其 DVC 无法通过信任列表核验（<a3>STT-VER-006</a3>）。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:37
msgid "Precondition: the issuer's DSC is on the trust list. XXR's document signer certificate (DSC), issued under XXR's Country Signing CA (CSCA), was shared with the GDHCN, the Trust Anchor, before any DVC is signed; the GDHCN publishes it as a DID document. Sharing it is not a step of issuing. A DVC signed with a key whose DSC was never shared fails every receiver's trust-list check (<a0>STT-VER-006</a0>)."
msgstr "前提条件：签发方的 DSC 位于信任列表上。XXR 的文档签名证书（DSC）由 XXR 的国家签名证书颁发机构（CSCA）签发，在签署任何 DVC 之前已与作为信任锚的 GDHCN 共享；GDHCN 将其作为 DID 文档发布。共享它不是签发的步骤。用 DSC 从未被共享的密钥签名的 DVC，在每个接收方的信任列表核验中都会失败（<a0>STT-VER-006</a0>）。"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:13
msgid "Print a signed record of each birth dose the family can carry anywhere"
msgstr "为每个出生剂次打印一份已签名的记录，让家庭可以随身携带到任何地方"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:14
msgid "Read a foreign vaccination QR offline and register the child with it"
msgstr "离线读取外国疫苗接种 QR 码，并据此登记儿童"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:20
msgid "Read a visiting child's summary and vaccinations from a QR the parent shows"
msgstr "从家长出示的 QR 码读取来访儿童的摘要和疫苗接种记录"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:15
msgid "Refer a child whose foreign record needs checking"
msgstr "转诊外国记录需要核验的儿童"

#: input/pagecontent/scenarios.md:16
msgid "Register a newborn into the household offline, before civil registration"
msgstr "在民事登记之前，离线将新生儿登记到家庭中"

